description:
Looking for a Legal Associate(Operations) for a Tech Platform in Mumbai!










**Job Responsibilities:** 










 o Identify and source potential arbitrators for empanelment;




 o Manage the end\-to\-end onboarding process of arbitrators, including explanation of process, responsibilities, fee structure, case handling guidelines, and documentation;




 o Conduct training sessions for newly empanelled arbitrators on how to use the platform;




 o Organise quarterly refresher trainings and workshops for existing arbitrators;




 o Create training resources, manuals, FAQs, and other support materials for arbitrators;




 o Act as the key liaison between the organisation and arbitrators for ongoing disputes;




 o Coordinate with arbitrators to schedule hearings and facilitate the passing of orders;




 o Facilitate smooth communication by setting up and managing WhatsApp groups;




 o Keep an updated database of arbitrators, training sessions, and certifications; and




 o Regularly engage with arbitrators to gather and implement feedback.










**Job Qualifications** 










 o LLB, B.Com, BMS, or a related field;




 o 1\+ years in stakeholder management, training, or legal / arbitration roles;




 o Strong communication and interpersonal skills with the ability to engage senior professionals;




 o Excellent organisational and coordination skills, with attention to detail;




 o Excellent analytical, problem\-solving, and communication (written and verbal) skills;
